{
  "bead_id": "B-bf21ece4",
  "title": "B1: YAML frontmatter parser (replace >> metadata)",
  "agent_type": "developer",
  "description": "Hand-roll a small YAML reader (~80 lines) inside CooklangParser.swift and/or Metadata.swift that detects and parses a --- ... --- frontmatter block when it is the first content in the file. Scalar values are stored verbatim under the bare key; list values (indented - items) are joined with ', ' and stored under the bare key. The old >> metadata syntax is dropped entirely \u2014 lines starting with >> become plain step text. Read Parser.swift, Scanner.swift, and Metadata.swift before designing the change. No third-party YAML library.",
  "status": "done",
  "bead_type": "task",
  "parent_id": "B-fa1cbeb6",
  "dependencies": [],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "--- frontmatter block detected when it is the first content in the file (blank lines and leading whitespace may precede it)",
    "Scalar YAML values (title: x, servings: 5) stored verbatim as strings under the bare key",
    "YAML list values (key: followed by indented - item lines) joined with ', ' and stored under the bare key",
    ">> lines no longer populate metadata; they are treated as plain step text",
    "Frontmatter --- delimiters do not appear in any step text",
    "No third-party YAML library added to Package.swift"
  ],
  "linked_docs": [
    "specs/drafts/0005-cookbookcore-parser-updates-yaml-frontmatter-and-modern-section-syntax.md"
